From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: expose optional legacy vendor policy controls

Register the vendor command and private WEXT surfaces with their complete
policy handlers and native station-lifetime admission checks.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

